---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /domain-for-sale/
title: "terms.co.uk Is For Sale | Make an Offer"
description: "The domain name terms.co.uk is for sale. Use the enquiry form to make an offer or ask a question about buying the domain."
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
  <ol class="wrap">
    <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
    <li aria-current="page">Domain for sale</li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<header class="page-hero page-hero--sale">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ icon("tag") }} Domain for sale</p>
    <h1>{{ site.domain }} is for sale</h1>
    <p class="lede">A short, exact-match .co.uk domain for a terms and conditions generator, legal documents, compliance or law firm brand. Use the form below to make an offer or ask a question.</p>
    <ul class="sale-points">
      <li>{{ icon("check") }} Single dictionary word that describes the product</li>
      <li>{{ icon("check") }} Short, easy to spell and easy to remember</li>
      <li>{{ icon("check") }} Transfer handled through a standard registrar push or escrow</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap wrap--narrow page-body">
  <section class="sale-form" aria-labelledby="sale-form-heading">
    <h2 id="sale-form-heading">Enquiry form</h2>
    <p>Fill in your details and offer. We will reply by email. You can also email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject={{ site.domain }}%20enquiry">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    {% include "partials/sale-form.njk" %}
  </section>
</div>
